      priority: external_exports3.number().int().optional().describe(
        "Stack-merge priority. When this preset is part of a stacked-preset arrangement (e.g. base typography + brand override on the same module/group slot), Divi sorts presets ascending and merges in priority order, so a higher number wins the cascade. Default in Divi is 10 when omitted. Only meaningful for presets that participate in a stack \u2014 solo presets render the same regardless of priority."
      ),
